        "id": 19434
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-26T11:33:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch. I have reverted to use `loop` statement for complex conditions and updates that require scratch variables. The simple loops will use `for` statement.",
      "parentUuid": "a1e011f7_60197934",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2256,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2256,
