      "message": "Another complexity around moving multiple next expressions into the loop body is if the expression has shadowed variables. If we moved this expression into the loop body, we\u0027d pick up the deeper `increment` variable set to 10. I think if we have more than 1 next expression, we need to keep it in a separate scope from the regular loop body.",
